  "description": "Contact times of four lunar eclipses from the NASA GSFC lunar eclipse catalogue (F. Espenak), for V-13. Contacts are transcribed from the per-eclipse figures (LEplot PDFs, which carry the contacts to the second but contain no extractable text) and are checked against the figures' own durations and against GSFC's yearly text pages (minute precision). Never edit these values to make a test pass; re-transcribe from the cited figure if in doubt.",
